# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com (no signup required, just
# verify the email you want submissions delivered to).
#
# Leave this blank during local development if you don't have a key yet —
# the contact form falls back to a simulated submission so the UI still
# works end-to-end. Once set, real submissions are POSTed to Web3Forms
# and delivered to your inbox.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
